Package: courieR
Type: Package
Title: R Package Courier: Cross-Platform Delivery Workbench
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lennon", "Li", , "lennon.yeli@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Syncs installed R packages between R installations on the same
    machine. Detects all R versions on the system (including non-admin and
    user-local installs) via find_routes(), compares package libraries via
    manifest() and inventory(), and installs or upgrades packages into any
    target R via ship(). Includes a Shiny dashboard (open_hub()) for
    point-and-click one-way or two-way sync without requiring any packages to
    be installed on the source R version.
